                <pb facs="0351" n="263" sameAs="frus:frus1958-60v05mSupp/pg263"/>

                <head>CH–22. Editorial Note</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian" when="1959-05-20"
                            >May 20, 1959</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>On May 20, 1959, representatives of the United States and Chile signed in
                    Washington an agreement providing for the Development Loan Fund to lend $300,000
                    to Chile to finance design engineering for a new international jet airport at
                    Pudahuel. Documentation concerning the loan is in ARA/WST Files, Lot 62 D 31,
                    “DLF.” For additional information, see Department of State <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, June 1, 1959, p. 834.</p>
            </div>
